user: https://usercenter-inf.maoyan.com/api/account/v1/getUserInfoByToken
shows: POST https://m.dianping.com/my/odea/project/shows、GET /my/odea/show/tickets（在售，token=dper，要 mtgsig）
preselect: https://yanchu.maoyan.com/my/odea/project/shows/preselect、/my/odea/show/tickets/preselect（未开售，token=dper；已开售返回业务码 1007）
sign: H5guard 1.2.0（static/maoyan/H5guard.js、package-1.2.0.js，horn 配置离线），环境补丁 static/maoyan/env.js、env_core.js
